    <item>
      <title>TINK TINK TINK</title>
      <link>https://killeik.online/tinkering/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://killeik.online/tinkering/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;tinkering&#34;&gt;Tinkering&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m constantly trying to improve the environment.&#xA;Whatever I do, if I know I&amp;rsquo;m going to be doing it for a long time, I try to make the processes more comfortable. Even before cooking I need to clean the kitchen, before sporoting I need to put on comfortable clothes and take drinking water.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;When it comes to working with computers, I know that I will be doing it for more than just the next day. I want to spend my whole life with computers.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
